>> scene deepForest style=bharni-earth
>> music forest
>> cast rama:exile at 0.4
>> cast sita:exile at 0.3
>> cast lakshmana:exile at 0.5
>> cast sage at 0.74 face=left
>> cast sage2 at 0.84 face=left scale=0.95
The Dandaka forest. Hermits come out of the trees to meet them, thin men who carry no weapons.
SAGE: Look at that heap, prince. Those are the bones of our brothers. The rakshasas eat us at our prayers.
RAMA: You should not have to ask. I am ashamed that you had to. They will not trouble you again while I live.
SITA: You have given your word to men who did not fight. Be careful with the bow, my lord. Carrying it changes the one who carries it.
RAMA: I hear you. But I have promised, and you know what I am about promises.
>> battle viradha
>> scene hermitage style=bharni-earth
>> music forest
>> enter sharabhanga from right to 0.7 in 0.1
>> enter rama:exile from left to 0.34 in 1
>> prop fire altar at 0.84 scale=0.7
Sharabhanga has put off his own death until he could see Rama. He blesses him, and walks into his fire.
>> scene ashram clear
>> enter rama:exile from left to 0.3 in 0.1
>> enter sita:exile from left to 0.2 in 0.1
>> enter lakshmana:exile from left to 0.42 in 0.1
Ten years go by among the hermitages. A month here, a season there. They are the quiet years.
>> scene hermitage clear
>> enter agastya from right to 0.66 in 0.1
>> enter rama:exile from left to 0.38 in 1
>> pose agastya give
AGASTYA: This bow was Vishnu's. These two quivers never empty. You will need them. Go to Panchavati, on the Godavari. It is a good place.
>> scene panchavati clear
>> prop hut hut at 0.66 scale=0.85
>> enter lakshmana:exile from right to 0.52 in 0.1
>> enter rama:exile from left to 0.3 in 1
>> enter sita:exile from left to 0.2 in 1.2
At Panchavati Lakshmana builds a hut of bamboo and leaves, alone, in a day.
RAMA: You knew what I wanted before I said it. It is as if our father were still alive.
>> enter jatayu from right to 0.86 in 1.6
An old vulture, very large, settles on the banyan and looks at them with one eye, then the other.
>> play tapSpots \{"hint":"viradha.12","spots":\[\{"who":"jatayu","y":90,"cue":"chime"\}\]\}
JATAYU: I am Jatayu. I flew with your father when we were both young. When you two go hunting, I will watch over Sita.
>> wash
-> END
